[p1] running constraint tests (every bad insert must be rejected)

Test fixtures: session 2091 (PMP, Lagos) and overlapping session 2092 (AZ-900, Abuja); valid booking 116821

=====================================================================
            CONSTRAINT TESTS (every bad row must be rejected)
=====================================================================
                                test                                 | result |                                      database_said                                       
---------------------------------------------------------------------+--------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 T1. UNIQUE candidate per session: c1 gets a 2nd seat in S1          | PASS   | duplicate key value violates unique constraint "uq_allocation_candidate_per_session"
 T2. UNIQUE seat per session: seat A given to c2 in S1               | PASS   | duplicate key value violates unique constraint "uq_allocation_seat_per_session"
 T3. EXCLUDE overlap: c1 booked into overlapping S2                  | PASS   | conflicting key value violates exclusion constraint "excl_candidate_no_overlap"
 T4. trigger: seat from another centre (Abuja seat in Lagos session) | PASS   | Seat 121 is not in the centre of session 2091
 T5. trigger: seat under maintenance                                 | PASS   | Seat A017 is maintenance, not active
 T6. trigger: registration of another candidate                      | PASS   | Registration 116821 is not this candidate's registration for this exam
 T7. CHECK payment > 0: amount = 0                                   | PASS   | new row for relation "payment" violates check constraint "chk_payment_amount_positive"
 T8. CHECK payment <= 100000: amount = 250000                        | PASS   | new row for relation "payment" violates check constraint "chk_payment_amount_reasonable"
 T9. UNIQUE payment reference: same reference twice                  | PASS   | duplicate key value violates unique constraint "payment_reference_key"
 T10. CHECK score 0-100: score = 150                                 | PASS   | new row for relation "result" violates check constraint "chk_result_score_range"
 T11. session that ends before it starts                             | PASS   | range lower bound must be less than or equal to range upper bound
 T12. CHECK duration 30-480 min: 600-minute exam                     | PASS   | new row for relation "exam" violates check constraint "exam_duration_minutes_check"
 T13. CHECK category: unknown exam category                          | PASS   | new row for relation "exam" violates check constraint "exam_category_check"
 T14. UNIQUE candidate email                                         | PASS   | duplicate key value violates unique constraint "candidate_email_key"
 T15. trigger: session already full (60 of 60 seats)                 | PASS   | Session 2094 is full: centre capacity is 60, already allocated 60
(15 rows)


